<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">QUOIN PHARMACEUTICALS LTD. </b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December 31, 2022 and 2021</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_zzBWfdVEjkuXmyW3R7cokw_cont1"><ix:continuation id="Tb_3llHIS2mYEuR-ZZ7A01xOw_cont1"></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Investor Exchange Warrant issued to the Investor on the Merger date was determined to be an equity-classified instrument, and accordingly the warrant liability on such date of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_df3FZjleZU2zXLAhNV_Aew" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_FinancialInstrumentAxis_qnrx_BridgeFinancingWarrantsMember_xKeprpicEUWbW1ctXOgsJg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:FairValueMeasurementWithUnobservableInputsReconciliationRecurringBasisLiabilityReclassificationsToEquity" scale="6" id="Narr_WuFe-s3lZkKg3_8SGYLJ3g">12.4</ix:nonFraction> million was reclassified to additional paid in capital. The Exchange Warrants issued to the 2020 Noteholders effective as of March 13, 2022 were determined to be an equity-classified instrument, and accordingly the warrant liability on such date of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_df3FZjleZU2zXLAhNV_Aew" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_FinancialInstrumentAxis_qnrx_Notes2020WarrantsMember_UG6_vudqTk22mFwGtctcVg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AdjustmentsToAdditionalPaidInCapitalWarrantIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_XFnddeSefUSUtu81AX_Z7Q">296,362</ix:nonFraction> was reclassified to additional paid in capital on that date.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_Hlk129517219"></a><a id="Tc_2TM8sU4bKEShlqQiMSg4uw_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_I9dUyVASR0KvCvfiyjsYgg_1_7"></a><a id="Tc_auQgBggjgEyOgSBwbxm0pQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_YU0VxUBHPEOupwSU-naCvQ_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_v-4xKcV5hUq4fBLiXWskiA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_ZgdjMmGTvkqvXF9M5zJbww_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_0c8Xi-mE3UaU5jiF9np2-g_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_Z0VQYE1uq0GBY3ZcFpegog_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_8Ux3oCJsjk-kqHtDkeIQEw_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_5M-hv2nn9UW0ykWNpeVanQ_4_7"></a><a id="Tc_ZCD8pTUBrk6i2cqCQtIDBA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_P1_GpV5MUUehCNcDp7CC4Q_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_STfLObPKykqMSd46YWLXSg_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_F0QvPKxB1U2Ktj0J1SsVUA_6_4"></a><a id="Tc_orT_NM_7xUCaJcwbQ8j7GQ_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_3kdqiuyl5UyShBDW8CG02g_7_4"></a><a id="Tc_Cieju1m8EkaWz13K6mCWlg_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_ZE87wxHy-EmgPQshQPviig_8_4"></a><a id="Tc_Bcto50bw_U2Kz4ZTZnvIzw_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_YsV9u-stVkOp55kPikcx-A_10_2"></a><a id="Tc_L87fV62TSkudRBjqoIMgiw_10_4"></a><a id="Tc_AEWrhSDKIUqUkR4GErkrLA_10_5"></a><a id="Tc_LsCPYoSp_U-ex2qh4I3ovw_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_iRMVi-HRVUWcq06x4N_WVA_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_BXdbwFIzk0yWcHHaX7e6rw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_29eHf2YLMEe92G__2LnKeQ_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_bIBhLgTKoUeRLEHQsc8teg_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_7yIgtBOoTkGLNU_NtQXauw_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_237p2HCoTEKE7sP0Zfr1eg_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_kgU7m91Jf0ORbktVpRzZvA_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_4yWmxYsoaEe21NkukfufvQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_Bwz2cWpIXkOw8xYOON_jOg_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_igMEmE7TaUi6j4cEmUkyRg_7_2"></a><a id="Tc_BxuWnQNcC0aDdjsUI0KT9Q_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_cFqEs0h85UakRImpBs-_GQ_8_2"></a><a id="Tc_HLL_3dQ000ahP3FZ0uPjMA_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_ENRZBVuk60CoPl2in06tDQ_9_2"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_MjGK2CkTR0aSuL2-VrcrTA" name="us-gaap:DisclosureOfCompensationRelatedCostsShareBasedPaymentsTextBlock" id="Tb_V9N4IMo6Z0KFOpTXyOjKHA" continuedAt="Tb_V9N4IMo6Z0KFOpTXyOjKHA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">NOTE&#160;7&#160;&#8211; STOCK BASED COMPENSATION</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In March 2022, the Board of Directors of the Company approved the Amended and Restated Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;Amended Plan&#8221;) which increased the number of ordinary shares reserved for issuance under such equity incentive plan to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_vf2MYNx-4UaRBp-ukIvVng" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_Juey-pmG7kGVPn1uqxznWQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardPercentageOfOutstandingStockMaximum" scale="-2" id="Narr_8ETDbaA3JE2NsPdMbCvZzw">15</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s outstanding ordinary shares on a fully-diluted basis, or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_uigvcIcA-0qx2gTISLhi_A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_vg2mBYI25kiTQMZeCJP1vA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_UJoYNZeub0WlLyrnDbG1zQ">6,391,925,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares, represented by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_uigvcIcA-0qx2gTISLhi_A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_DoslMBlJRUSw5tNM_BEN8g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_ltUXLkqlm0ScXI_rnRv16w">1,278,385</ix:nonFraction> ADSs as of December 31, 2022. Under the Amended Plan, the Company may grant options to its directors, officers, employees, consultants, advisers and service providers. The Amended Plan was approved by the shareholders at the Company&#8217;s Annual General Meeting of Shareholders held on April 12, 2022.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;">On April 12, 2022, the Company granted options to acquire </span><span style="font-size:10pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_uigvcIcA-0qx2gTISLhi_A" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_-4S-GrhcsU6nIFbPGv09jg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:NumberOfCommonStockIssuedUponExerciseOfOptionsGranted" scale="0" id="Narr_XfYg077YAECpxlSZovAoDA">1,535,714,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:10pt;"> ordinary shares, represented by </span><span style="font-size:10pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_uigvcIcA-0qx2gTISLhi_A" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_NzWJQxpBeE2xROXlifSsNg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:NumberOfCommonStockIssuedUponExerciseOfOptionsGranted" scale="0" id="Narr_nHsbYwTyj0OHUgPXNFaCDA">307,142</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:10pt;"> ADSs, at </span><span style="font-size:10pt;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_f-Iw-_7kF0Wo7clLz9E5qQ" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_NzWJQxpBeE2xROXlifSsNg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsExercisesInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_-2CFVpKmUEKnIFECw8GWfQ">17.50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:10pt;"> per share to management, directors and employees and </span><span style="font-size:10pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_uigvcIcA-0qx2gTISLhi_A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_vg2mBYI25kiTQMZeCJP1vA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_1fUSgiv-dUqRmm9OhHe8qg">971,243</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-size:10pt;"> shares remained available for issuance as of December 31, 2022. Such options vest over a </span><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_IYn3fOukjEWyrsovD-ojBg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three</span></span><span style="font-size:10pt;"> or </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_Zflr48yoX02-hYbCzaAGzA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_AM_4zl01mEabD4n4CNITUw"><span style="font-size:10pt;">four year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-size:10pt;"> period. There were </span><span style="font-size:10pt;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_uigvcI